# 🧠 Quick Revision

| Concept | Key Point |
|---|---|
| Synchronous | Executes sequentially |
| Asynchronous | Allows other work while waiting |
| Promise | Represents a future result |
| `resolve()` | Successful Promise |
| `reject()` | Failed Promise |
| `.then()` | Handles fulfilled Promise |
| `.catch()` | Handles rejection |
| `.finally()` | Runs after settlement |
| `async` | Makes a function return a Promise |
| `await` | Waits for a Promise inside an async function |
| `fetch()` | Makes HTTP requests |
| `response.json()` | Parses JSON response |
| `Promise.all()` | Waits for multiple Promises |
| `try/catch` | Handles async errors |

